From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 22:27:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/sysfs: protect prep action writing (patch 13 fixup)

For the context:
https://lore.kernel.org/20260901052446.4122-1-sj@kernel.org

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/sysfs.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/mm/damon/sysfs.c b/mm/damon/sysfs.c
index cad2d70788537..768b6b49f0b0f 100644
--- a/mm/damon/sysfs.c
+++ b/mm/damon/sysfs.c
@@ -827,7 +827,10 @@ static ssize_t prep_action_store(struct kobject *kobj,
 
 		action_name = &damon_sysfs_prep_action_names[i];
 		if (sysfs_streq(buf, action_name->name)) {
+			if (!mutex_trylock(&damon_sysfs_lock))
+				return -EBUSY;
 			prep->action = action_name->action;
+			mutex_unlock(&damon_sysfs_lock);
 			ret = count;
 			break;
 		}
-- 
2.47.3

